window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The rules have changed.</b></p> <p>Reeling from the events that revealed other witches were behind the attack on Reuben and Caspian, the White Haven witches don’t know who to trust.</p> <p>The search for those who betrayed them tests their resources and their abilities, and as the fallout shatters alliances, they draw on their friends for support.</p> <p>But it’s not easy. The path they follow is dark and twisted and leads them in directions they can’t predict.</p> <p><i>Knowing who to trust is the only thing that may save them.</i></p> <p><b>Grab the ninth book in the White Haven Witches series now, but be warned, nothing is as it seems…</b></p>"; 
